    "It has no password: it always opens, for you and for anyone who has the file. Keep it where you'd keep your photos." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Δεν έχει κωδικό: ανοίγει πάντα, για σένα και για όποιον έχει το αρχείο. Κράτα το εκεί που θα κρατούσες τις φωτογραφίες σου."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It has no password: it always opens, for you and for anyone who has the file. Keep it where you'd keep your photos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its badge will be removed. Your title and what you got stay." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Το έμβλημά του θα αφαιρεθεί. Ο τίτλος σου και ό,τι πήρες μένουν."
